| T167 | RB8-05 | A line-art name of `.`, `..`, `manifest.json`, or the row color name is refused before any write. |
| T168 | RB8-06 | A Muse print that is a symlink or a directory is refused. |
| T169 | RB8-07 | A wrong list version, an unknown row id, and a traversal name are refused. This test passes at HEAD. |
| T170 | Review A F1 | A copy write failure leaves no `manifest.json`. This test passes at HEAD and fails when the manifest moves before the copies. |
| T171 | Review C F2 | A palette, one-channel, 16-bit, or four-channel color print is refused. |
| T172 | Review C F3 | `onSkip(rowId, reason)` is called once for a row without an approval entry. |

